qQbKN4G4hPVkYCWgqz_ZQJidle_x3tWXq2DLahVLp0n3FFTYKZg_Y43Q4nlfY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOAQGGeRFk-Y2CE6hD6SI-E9HawYL1TWdsbDNwdxFjuOQ&oe=6AE4A257"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ws5CCnkShm8Q7kNvwF42BU9&_nc_oc=AdrfTQvJ_C6SG-fsrYy4nDfM3t1hQKGKqSinn4T5WhpwYEaM_CtxVYtzifjutglKakE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOUSsVavMCetwLKlO-jLk8R-thiofZtsXZACKhsC_vIOw&oe=6AE4A061"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4H3wic0MgSkQ7kNvwF_DuIW&_nc_oc=AdqWfZiKLkaIRc6qP0e-dLgjvs_nn4ZEyUmaOL-t_CTcdFR7IqeR0fCZxE0g4bfg4mw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM5SXz_seZY97mHtxI_gBbcbVpeKajXEdpHHrqKShELyQ&oe=6AE48E97"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=shAXTk689qYQ7kNvwElado1&_nc_oc=AdrfqLTn0sqsTl56n9j-dkeyx69G838fj-B8D58NiiLixcOKFcOX9IIB35HqaE6bE4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPXBmbgpI6Tzv2YBCS_e7ybxHC3apNctBnY3RUvYAFmsA&oe=6AE49522"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rAliyRcDqioQ7kNvwG4R9Ea&_nc_oc=Adopopkv3m-jlvowU47hLpNY1s8EPr0BpfyleK5beDn-UEIgDz3ngljPpg_KH4oPwag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMKgEzXR4CU6Z8TbaleQ68tzGPG8nw1E0Dpf2oyDByjVg&oe=6AE4B9AE"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null